msgid "Burn after reading"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-admin.php:202
msgid "A share with burn after reading can be opened by one person, once. The recipient first sees an Open button, so link previews in chat and email apps do not use it up. After opening, that browser can read the note and download the files for the time set in the settings. The share is destroyed as soon as every file has been downloaded, or when that time is up. A share with only a note is destroyed the moment it is shown."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-admin.php:203
msgid "Use Preview to look at a share yourself without opening it."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-admin.php:209
#: includes/class-health.php:61
msgid "Security"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-admin.php:210
msgid "Files are encrypted on disk with a key per file, stored under random names in a folder the web server refuses to serve, and only handed out through the share page. Notes, links and passwords are encrypted in the database. Wrong passwords are limited to 5 per 15 minutes per visitor."
msgstr ""

